  {
   "id": "lost-ember-rekindled-edition-314439@1.0.6",
   "gameId": "lost-ember-rekindled-edition-314439",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.6",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-12-03T19:19:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi all!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We just uploaded another patch with a couple of quick fixes for reported issues:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "some translations in the legendary souls map lost their ID and weren't correctly shown",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "in some cases the game could be saved when at a location without escape. This should now lo longer happen - and if it still does the game will check the current location on load and transport the player to a valid location",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "music volume was reset for some tracks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "the menu for collectibles of the main story is no longer accessible (or in case of legendary animals unlockable) from the legendary souls map to avoid confusion",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "the quest menu was not navigable by gamepad when opened from a quest notification",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "sliders in the menu can no longer reach negative values",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "increased default camera speed to more closely match original game: Hope that solves most of your issues, but if not please continue to reach out and report anything you still encounter!: Your moonies",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
