  {
   "id": "lost-ember-rekindled-edition-314439@post-2025-11-29",
   "gameId": "lost-ember-rekindled-edition-314439",
   "displayName": "Save Game synchronisation issue with old Lost Ember game",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-11-29T12:46:39.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi all,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "we just uploaded a quick patch after some of you reported issues with saved games in the old Lost Ember. If you previously opened an old savegame file with the new Rekindled version, it was no longer shown in the old game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That should no longer happen with this patch!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Unfortunately, for now, the patch does not include a way to reset the savegame so the old Lost Ember can read it. So if you already saved over your old files, you can simply send us the files and we'll repair them manually for you! We'll look further into an automatic way of doing that.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Best,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your moonies",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
